{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38882","headline":"赠友人罢举赴交趾辟命 · 杜荀鹤","name":"赠友人罢举赴交趾辟命","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"罢却名场拟入秦，南行无罪似流人。\n纵经商岭非驰驿，须过长沙吊逐臣。\n舶载海奴鐶硾耳，象驼蛮女彩缠身。\n如何待取丹霄桂，别赴嘉招作上宾。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜荀鹤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38882.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38882","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}